OL,5,G1330 Music Map
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch traces musical
OL,7,     Fconnections with Jean-Philippe
OL,8,     FRameau's 'Tristes apprets', the
OL,9,     Fexquisite aria from his 1737 opera
OL,10,     FCastor et Pollux.
OL,11,G1500 Music Matters: How to listen
OL,12,     F1/3. Conductor Sakari Oramo opens
OL,13,     Fa window into the art of attentive
OL,14,     Flistening. Today, Sakari explores
OL,15,     Fthe act of listening itself - what
OL,16,     Fdo we actually hear when we listen
OL,17,     Fto music?
