OL,10,     Fmusician.
OL,11,G1945 Words and Music
OL,12,     FInspired by the American frontier
OL,13,     Fspirit, the call of the West, the
OL,14,     Fstark beauty of the landscape and
OL,15,     Fthe grit of the people who lived
OL,16,     Fthere, from indigenous nations to
OL,17,     Fsettlers.
